**Headline finding first:** `/workspace/Project6-File_System/drivers/net.c` contains a **complete, working reference implementation** of all three P5 stubs. Every supporting file is **byte-identical** between P5 and P6:

```
diff -u P5/drivers/net.h            P6/drivers/net.h            -> identical
diff -u P5/kernel/irq/irq.c         P6/kernel/irq/irq.c         -> identical
diff -u P5/drivers/plic.c           P6/drivers/plic.c           -> identical
